{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1761844,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Vihaan X: Hardware Track","festival_id":519244,"organization_id":306,"web_url":"vihaan.ieeedtu.in\/","start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-15T17:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/vihaan-x-hardware-track-vihaan-x-ieee-dtu-dtu-new-delhi-1761844","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>About the Competition<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vihaan X is one of North India's largest student-run hackathons, organized by IEEE DTU.<\/li>\n<li>The Hardware Track challenges participants to turn innovative ideas into tangible, working prototypes that solve real-world problems.<\/li>\n<li>Teams collaborate under time pressure, designing and building functional hardware solutions within an intensive 24-hour sprint.<\/li>\n<li>The track is built around creativity, technical experimentation, and genuine hands-on engineering &mdash; not just theory.<\/li>\n<li>It's a platform where builders think fast, iterate faster, and walk away with something real.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware Track Domains<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>IoT<\/strong> &ndash; Connected devices and intelligent systems<\/li>\n<li><strong>AgriTech<\/strong> &ndash; Technology for modern agriculture and farming<\/li>\n<li><strong>Smart City &amp; Civic Tech<\/strong> &ndash; Urban infrastructure and governance solutions<\/li>\n<li><strong>Sustainability<\/strong> &ndash; Climate-conscious and eco-friendly innovations<\/li>\n<li><strong>Open Innovation<\/strong> &ndash; Build anything innovative beyond the defined tracks; bring your own unique idea to life<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Size<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximum of 4 participants per team.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rounds:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Day 1<\/strong>: Building and developing projects, from core features to a working prototype<\/li>\n<li><strong>Day 2 (around 10 AM):<\/strong> Project evaluation and judging<\/li>\n<li><strong>Final Round:<\/strong> Shortlisted teams present to industry experts<\/li>\n<li>Winners are announced after final presentations improvise it<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Learning Opportunities<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Direct mentorship from experienced industry professionals throughout the event<\/li>\n<li>Hands-on exposure to circuit design, prototyping, and hardware development<\/li>\n<li>Real-world engineering practice built on teamwork and collaborative problem-solving<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting cash prizes and exclusive rewards for winning teams<\/li>\n<li>Recognition for the most innovative and impactful hardware solutions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>The Opportunity<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vihaan X creates an electrifying environment where creativity, teamwork, and innovation collide.<\/li>\n<li>Participants don't just build prototypes &mdash; they build practical, real-world experience in hardware development.<\/li>\n<li>Whether you're a first-timer or a seasoned builder, this is 24 hours to prove what you can create.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Venue:&nbsp;<\/strong>Delhi Technological University<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Compete to win exciting cash prizes, certificates, goodies, and exclusive rewards.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":8454706,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-26T10:37:34+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T20:01:52+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"muTsx3c","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"displ